<title>BRAZIL: Brazil December exports at $3.7 bln - TV.</title>
<headline>Brazil December exports at $3.7 bln - TV.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian exports in December totalled $3.7 billion, with an average daily amount of $189 million, a local television said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>TV Globo said December figures took 1996 exports to total $47.7 billion, with a rise of a slight 2.7 percent over 1995.</p>
<p>Official export figures for December will be revealed today by the Ministry of Industry and Commerce at 1430 local/1630 GMT.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
